# SES Component

AWS Simple Email Service adapter that sends monitoring event notifications via email.

## Key Integration Pattern
Direct AWS SDK v1 integration without retry logic, relying on SDK defaults for resilience.

## Important Constraints
- Categorize SES-specific errors (message_rejected, domain_not_verified) for granular metrics
- No connection pooling - each Publish() creates a new SES API call
- Support dynamic documentation URL injection in email bodies based on event groups